% Software; no paper describes Hubs itself. Repository github.com/Hubs-Foundation/hubs
% (MPL-2.0, "multi-user virtual spaces in WebVR, built with A-Frame"). Mozilla's support
% article "End of support for Mozilla Hubs": Mozilla ended the hosted service on 31 May 2024 and
% the code is now maintained by the Hubs Foundation. Physics: the client runs ammo.js in a web
% worker (src/systems/physics-system.js) and networked-aframe syncs objects, i.e. client-side
% physics, as the draft says.
@misc{hubs,
  author       = {{Mozilla} and {Hubs Foundation}},
